  "title": "GC lower band: filter improvement remains uncertain",
  "summary": "An upper-half signal close was selected in 2025. Its chronological 2026 improvement remains uncertain, and the filtered score is negative; this is conditional path evidence.",
  "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T23:09:36Z",
