  "sections": [
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "question",
      "title": "Question and scope",
      "body": "Can a simple signal-time filter improve GC outer-lower EMA band long excursions? The saved comparison covers 2025 and 2026 YTD, next complete five-minute unadjusted open, ten-bar cooldown and twenty-bar future horizon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "findings",
      "title": "Supported findings",
      "body": "The frozen selection chose upper-half close. The chronological check improved directionally, but its difference interval spans zero and its score remains negative. All nine filters and the unfiltered baseline are retained below, rather than selecting only favorable rows."
